{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Microjam </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a cute, casual collection of microgames that features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/e696f5231603c92a2dea7ae8c9a1c222.avif?t=1761946109\" alt=\"Micro Games\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">50 microgames spread across 5 packs of 10 games each!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Simple inputs, mouse only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/2b366829fa2adcb10493fc6318c6c147.avif?t=1761946109\" alt=\"Game Modes\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bundles of 10 microgames where you get to lay back and test the waters. No lives, no pressure! Not dying rewards you with 5 stars on the micropack you were playing, which may unlock new stuff!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In infinite mode, all of the games you unlocked get combined into a single fast paced experience. The better you play, the faster and more difficult the games get</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play singular microgames as many times as you need to figure them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/0670a94cf1b1d3098ef505a6b3c97f1d.avif?t=1761946109\" alt=\"Collectables\" width=1560 height=116 /></span>In endless mode, beating microgames at max level will spawn a sticker machine, where you can unlock shiny stickers for your beautiful collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/12e20979a25a8940b86e21c07d2dba0d.avif?t=1761946109\" alt=\"Casual Progression\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks can be unlocked through achieving certain goals ingame, such as beating many microgames  in infinite mode, or getting 5 stars on a micropack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every game from the Micropacks you unlocked will appear in infinite mode</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Basics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/4f06f9b9a73a3289aa4558e1460446231bc43990.jpg"},{"name":"Take a picture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/e8d41ea38bb688ba14b62c4fea22158a058f6272.jpg"},{"name":"Spooky Season","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/a0f60b8a4662f8c774f0d620a57ce2ca378d015b.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Dating","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/ec4e80d4882fa9359b2efc5ab85d8f4d6b47afb1.jpg"},{"name":"It's been a while","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/509754bf613aa71c621ae268dc6219575df6b416.jpg"},{"name":"Perfectionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4009430/6c351fe238002e3dd3a03b7a18b05889c9106592.jpg"},{"name":"Pennyless Gambling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/imag